@API @StatusCodes\nFeature: Verify status codes for all PetStore operations\n  As an API consumer\n  I want to verify the status codes for all PetStore operations\n  So that I can ensure the API returns correct status codes\n\nBackground:\n  Given the PetStore API is available and accessible\n\n@CreatePet @StatusCode\nScenario: Verify status code for creating a new pet\n  Given I have a pet creation payload with the following details\n    | Name      | Status      | Category | Tags      |\n    | Buddy     | available   | Dog      | Friendly  |\n  When I send a POST request to create the pet\n  Then the response status code should be 200\n\n@RetrievePet @StatusCode\nScenario: Verify status code for retrieving an existing pet by valid ID\n  Given I have successfully created a pet with the following details\n    | Name      | Status      | Category | Tags      |\n    | Charlie   | available   | Dog      | Friendly  |\n  When I retrieve the pet by ID\n  Then the response status code should be 200\n\n@UpdatePet @StatusCode\nScenario: Verify status code for updating an existing pet with new details\n  Given I have successfully created a pet with the following details\n    | Name      | Status      | Category | Tags      |\n    | Max       | available   | Dog      | Guard     |\n  When I update the pet with generated ID with new details\n    | Name      | Status      | Category | Tags      |\n    | Maximus   | sold        | Dog      | Guard     |\n  Then the response status code should be 200\n\n@DeletePet @StatusCode\nScenario: Verify status code for deleting an existing pet by valid ID\n  Given I have successfully created a pet with the following details\n    | Name      | Status      | Category | Tags      |\n    | Daisy     | available   | Bird     | Calm      |\n  When I delete the pet with generated ID\n  Then the response status code should be 200